{"surah":95,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>تِّينِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>زَّيْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">تُو</span>نِ","وَطُورِ سِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">نِي</span>نَ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>ذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَلَدِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مِي</span>نِ","لَقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> خَلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>نَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">فِىٓ</span> أَحْسَنِ تَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">وِي</span>مٍ","ثُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> رَدَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>هُ أَسْفَلَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>فِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">لِي</span>نَ","إِلَّا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">صَّٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>تِ فَلَهُمْ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>رٌ غَيْرُ مَمْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">نُو</span>نٍ","فَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعْدُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِّي</span>نِ","أَلَيْسَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ بِأَحْكَمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>كِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مِي</span>نَ"]}